[SIZE="4"][B]Bug reports[/B][/SIZE]

Include the exact model and stock firmware, the installation method, a description of the problem, and /tmp/recovery.log. Do not report issues from a Y210 or another MT6572 device.

[SIZE="4"][B]Changelog[/B][/SIZE]

[B]2026-10-21[/B]

[LIST]
[*]Fixed restore failing with "Failed to mount '/system' (Out of memory)". UBIFS needs a large contiguous memory block on every mount, and after a big backup or restore the page cache left none, so a full restore stopped before writing System. A small service now keeps the page cache low; a full backup plus a full restore in one run works.
[*]ADB now reports the device as Y220-U05 instead of 0123456789ABCDEF.
[*]Same kernel and TWRP binary as the previous build; only the recovery init changed.
[/LIST]

[B]2026-10-12[/B]

[LIST]
[*]First build with kernel #92: touchscreen, capacitive keys, UBIFS mounts, backup and ZIP install.
[/LIST]

